message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "GEQIE: General Equation of Quantum Image Encoding"
abstract: "GEQIE is an open-source Python framework that unifies quantum image representation methods of the Quantum Lattice family using a common model based on position and value maps. Each method is specified by four Python functions, from which a unitary encoding gate is constructed and transpiled by Qiskit for simulators or IBM quantum hardware."
